feat(website): add launch gate with countdown, waitlist, and route protection

The entire website is now locked behind a server-side middleware redirect
until September 3, 2026 at 06:00 AM IST. Every route (/, /docs, /changelog,
etc.) redirects to /launch before any HTML is generated — not bypassable
from the client since the decision is made in edge middleware before the
response exists.

The /launch page has:
- Real-time countdown with calendar-page-turn flip animation on each digit
- Email waitlist form backed by /api/waitlist (validates, deduplicates, stores)
- Floating particle canvas background
- Staggered entrance animations via Framer Motion
- Feature teaser grid (no links, no hints about what's behind the gate)
- Responsive — works cleanly on mobile through desktop

After the unlock timestamp passes, the middleware becomes a transparent
pass-through and the launch page is unreachable (no one links to it, and
direct /launch access just shows a page with an expired countdown that
immediately redirects to /).

Added:
- website/middleware.ts (edge middleware, route gating)
- website/app/launch/page.tsx (countdown + waitlist page)
- website/app/api/waitlist/route.ts (email collection endpoint)
